{"id":"1394343937","type":"page","ari":"ari:cloud:confluence:9041264b-18e1-49d1-aa92-7b0360160143:page/1394343937","base64EncodedAri":"YXJpOmNsb3VkOmNvbmZsdWVuY2U6OTA0MTI2NGItMThlMS00OWQxLWFhOTItN2IwMzYwMTYwMTQzOmNvbnRlbnQvMTM5NDM0MzkzNw==","status":"current","title":"Event-Based Contracts Expansion to 24-7 Trading","version":{"by":{"type":"known","accountId":"712020:49d0cbb6-73d4-4b64-a2e5-139b080f4c87","accountType":"app","email":"","publicName":"test","profilePicture":{"path":"/wiki/aa-avatar/712020:49d0cbb6-73d4-4b64-a2e5-139b080f4c87","width":48,"height":48,"isDefault":false},"displayName":"Space Sync for Confluence (Copy & Publish Pages over Sites)","isExternalCollaborator":false,"isGuest":false,"accountStatus":"active","_expandable":{"operations":"","personalSpace":""},"_links":{"self":"https://cmegroupclientsite.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/user?accountId=712020:49d0cbb6-73d4-4b64-a2e5-139b080f4c87"}},"when":"2026-04-23T13:12:28.596Z","friendlyWhen":"Apr 23, 2026","message":"","number":4,"minorEdit":false,"ncsStepVersion":"33","ncsStepVersionSource":"ncs-ack","confRev":"confluence$content$1394343937.116","contentTypeModified":false,"_expandable":{"collaborators":"","content":"/rest/api/content/1394343937"},"_links":{"self":"https://cmegroupclientsite.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/1394343937/version/4"}},"macroRenderedOutput":{},"body":{"view":{"value":"<p local-id=\"90d0755a4053\">Starting at <strong>4 p.m. Central Time on Friday, May 29, 2026,</strong> CME Group will expand <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/457220544/Event+Contracts\" data-linked-resource-id=\"457220544\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">event contracts</a> to 24/7 trading, including <em><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"6ce3c360-e263-459b-8b02-13e5d4a7087a\">event contracts</span> on Bitcoin</em>.  The <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">technology </a>and <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">timeline</a> align with the upcoming <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Cryptocurrency Futures and Options Migration to 24-7 Trading</a>.</p><p local-id=\"eed027379cd3\">Event contracts will trade continuously on CME Globex with at least a two-hour weekly maintenance period occurring on weekends. All holiday or weekend trading from Friday evening through Sunday evening will have a trade date of the following business day, with clearing, settlement and regulatory reporting processed the following business day.</p><p local-id=\"624fe1c2edf8\">This topic outlines information for processing event contracts for 24/7 trading.</p><p local-id=\"44838559c0c1\"><strong>Contents</strong></p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-structure=\"list\" data-numberedoutline=\"false\" data-cssliststyle=\"default\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"toc\" data-macro-id=\"43944c17-913c-44fc-a0b2-d2f9ac2fba7f\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"207d518d-4772-4cb9-add0-26eb1cb230b1\"> </div><h1 local-id=\"b5e5b2f71c5d\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-RevisionHistory\">Revision History</h1><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-table-width=\"1800\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-local-id=\"7c88e3e0-0dd0-4c95-806f-67f48310f87f\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 1458.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr data-local-id=\"7fb76de7-53a3-4fdc-9ea3-4b8e58e9cf2b\"><th data-local-id=\"a82703ed-9427-48f3-bea0-5e289c088c79\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"33225ef97d53\"><strong>Date</strong></p></th><th data-local-id=\"5e0edce2-20c6-41ef-9014-1afe13b4cf69\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"8b1509447c99\"><strong>Description</strong></p></th></tr><tr data-local-id=\"bbfe9200fa2e\"><td data-local-id=\"b59f29a3b1ea\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"83d5feed665a\">April 22, 2026</p></td><td data-local-id=\"c0ca8e8e7838\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"a6e909cf08f3\">Added <a href=\"https://cmegroupclientsite.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1394343937/Event-Based+Contracts+Expansion+to+24-7+Trading#Event-Based-Contract-Maintenance-Windows-and-Market-Hours\" rel=\"nofollow\">Event-Based Contract Maintenance Windows and Market Hours</a> schedule impacts.</p></td></tr><tr data-local-id=\"e88aa684-106e-4d23-8d3f-9d8f2f09af37\"><td data-local-id=\"06886a1a-e8a6-4f84-9b54-fc677efa7452\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"cb942ffa6257\">March 25, 2026</p></td><td data-local-id=\"2a187339-e7f4-423a-9c22-032921087fc7\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"c82df4a2aaf4\">Initial publication</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 local-id=\"75141b508d84\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-KeyEventsandDates\">Key Events and Dates</h1><p local-id=\"a1a636565c6c\">The following table outlines key project milestones and availability dates, including Market Data Platform 3.0 (MDP 3.0) channel 329 <span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"38f02d8d-3fea-4516-a8b0-c6d53919d46e\">expansion </span>to support 24/7 trading. </p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-table-width=\"1401\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-local-id=\"8f24f802-1a48-44f7-91e3-2a494318135f\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 278.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 1123.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr data-local-id=\"908ecaef-18b6-4a80-b833-b8ad8a4c19ca\"><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f1f2\" data-local-id=\"4d916d1c-47f3-4587-8b72-2f2533712f46\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"265bec274ab7\"><strong>Date</strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f1f2\" data-local-id=\"a01c44d5-24b4-4f93-9bd7-64a9cc065174\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"4237438425d1\"><strong>Milestone</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-local-id=\"b4b7c73a1a32\"><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"a051ede2-ad7d-43bb-85fc-0134ee30d04c\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"8aa316f7e2e6\">Thursday, April 2, 2026</p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"fc2ef683-3998-4cc3-b46e-e0639eb4d93c\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"23b6f05ac7bf\">New Release Launch includes support for:</p><ul local-id=\"47903b5c-1dec-445d-92a2-801e04007226\"><li local-id=\"f882b218-83db-4e99-9dd8-256a1d7b92b6\"><p local-id=\"3b57bfad30bf\">Globex iLink, Drop Copy and Market Data.</p></li><li local-id=\"2a83c745-8c30-4740-86e0-83259ee8b333\"><p local-id=\"770247dd06cd\">STP</p></li><li local-id=\"25c5dafb-a43f-422f-aba5-c1bc9dc24b75\"><p local-id=\"03a944ff5231\">Streamlined Block Trades channel 235</p></li><li local-id=\"546f2f24-8631-44aa-b473-7f40fd3d1ea3\"><p local-id=\"ab8e42dadb83\">Reference Data API</p></li><li local-id=\"c6a6419e-4510-43f5-b6de-7cfdd91d4d8b\"><p local-id=\"ea7677e0ecbc\">Streamlined CME CF-Rates and Indexes channel 214</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-local-id=\"97d975c1b124\"><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"ad143667-42c3-461d-b9e2-51c5bee2e82f\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"4cee74328870\">Sunday, April 26, 2026</p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"e34141c2-790f-4a84-9cc1-ff96d637210d\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><ul local-id=\"ff5890d8-a9df-40ba-8633-0ab274d780c0\"><li local-id=\"4aa592e8-c39f-4390-a550-e8f7997eec6e\"><p local-id=\"bb143898caeb\">Production Access to new 24/7 CME Globex Convenience Gateway (CGW) sessions</p></li><li local-id=\"de75cf711c54\"><p local-id=\"35bfd9a4ebbe\"><a href=\"https://www.cmegroup.com/solutions/market-access/globex/globex-resources.html?_gl=1*15np3ub*_gcl_au*MTQyMTQyMTUxMC4xNzY4MzM2NjEw*_ga*MTA2ODA2OTQ1Mi4xNzY4MzM2NjEw*_ga_L69G7D7MMN*czE3NzIwNTA4MDkkbzEwNyRnMSR0MTc3MjA1NTkwMCRqNjAkbDAkaDA.#mdp30tcpipupdate\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\"><u>MDP 3.0 Market Data Recovery IP and port update</u></a></p></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-local-id=\"5f242554d531\"><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"feefbcbb-b8ac-491d-bd86-2fdfdf82b2aa\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"721b17529cd8\">Friday, May 29, 2026, starting at 4:00 p.m. CT</p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"ed8a6e66-bc27-4b32-ac2e-478fa2684379\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"12306d5e53f3\">Production Launch</p><ul local-id=\"352d3b60-4ca6-4483-9181-8825bb63e821\"><li local-id=\"6233a723-4cc1-4f7e-9586-c80d9886afc0\"><p local-id=\"6fafa5f275c0\">CGW clients requiring weekend trading capabilities must migrate to the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"><u>new 24/7 sessions</u></a>.</p></li><li local-id=\"7cdaddb9-8a19-4fb4-b579-9ef79e0a1dcc\"><p local-id=\"01cb9096fc1d\">Clients that want to trade during the weekend must migrate to the order entry service gateway (<a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"><u>OESGW</u></a>).</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 local-id=\"b7c725425c99\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-TestingandCertification\">Testing and Certification</h1><p local-id=\"12d3d98359b6\">Certification <em>is not </em>required for customer systems already certified to <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/457219613/CME+MDP+3.0+Market+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"457219613\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">CME MDP 3.0 Market Data</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/457414209/iLink+Order+Entry\" data-linked-resource-id=\"457414209\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">iLink Order Entry</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/665190402/Drop+Copy+4.0+Service+for+iLink\" data-linked-resource-id=\"665190402\" data-linked-resource-version=\"13\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Drop Copy 4.0 Service for iLink</a>. Testing is strongly encouraged.</p><ul local-id=\"22d7edb96698\"><li local-id=\"1c9830e5d333\"><p local-id=\"75f7a8000e9c\">New release testing is available from Sunday, 5:00 p.m. Central Time (CT) to Friday, 4:00 p.m. CT.</p></li><li local-id=\"4156be7b218f\"><p local-id=\"25af5487231d\">Weekend testing is not available.</p></li></ul><h1 local-id=\"0a3e5597ac55\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-SummaryofImpacts\">Summary of Impacts</h1><ul local-id=\"7a8d1d51-431d-4940-ada6-47381819d87f\"><li local-id=\"ab29d146-fe86-4512-816f-9f36a34ea272\"><p local-id=\"313adc5e0efc\">Migration of <span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"9d6b5caf-8051-4eea-a5fc-733b0fdeef12\">event contracts</span> on Bitcoin to 24/7 trading - (includes holidays, Saturday and Sunday)</p></li><li local-id=\"2bf011e8-fa35-4fff-9c60-27dde912af47\"><p local-id=\"4f1d27de3859\">MDP 3.0 channel 329 will migrate to 24/7 trading</p></li><li local-id=\"7dfd3dd8-bd4e-4cb3-a9c2-bc2abbade21d\"><p local-id=\"e4b619d71022\">New Convenience Gateway (CGW) sessions are <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">required</a> for 24/7 trading</p><ul local-id=\"7d4406f8-4ec5-43fb-9509-ffb4598a9e65\"><li local-id=\"bbbdd5d0-f794-48c8-b597-ee118f287145\"><p local-id=\"bb4a20774f4d\">Clients who prefer to <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">continue five day trading</a> can use existing CGW sessions</p></li></ul></li><li local-id=\"422be66d-f535-4cfa-bbb8-aea4a99b0ae3\"><p local-id=\"c810f5ac28ff\">The <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">CME Globex Sunday startup</a> will be eliminated for event contracts.</p></li><li local-id=\"78bb557d-ca27-4fe7-a686-770f4c3b0b31\"><p local-id=\"b17158c82b96\">Sequence numbers for iLink, Drop Copy, and market data will reset to 1 during the new <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Saturday startup</a>. </p></li></ul><h1 local-id=\"37e5595f9463\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-Event-BasedContractMaintenanceWindowsandMarketHours\">Event-Based Contract Maintenance Windows and Market <span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"491264c2-2e82-4434-8dac-7c6601017adc\">Hours</span></h1><p local-id=\"ed08c502e855\">This section outlines schedule impacts for all clients trading event-based contracts and currently applicable to Bitcoin event-based contracts.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-table-width=\"1160\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-local-id=\"4707f6b12655\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 191.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 264.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 313.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 391.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr data-local-id=\"3a8a1e2e-6764-4761-8a44-6a9076663853\"><th data-highlight-colour=\"#c2cace\" data-local-id=\"540c1d5f-d82d-4dd8-bcfe-afe7eea78e83\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"fef9a6046652\"><strong>Day</strong></p></th><th data-highlight-colour=\"#c2cace\" data-local-id=\"1f840259-d615-471b-94e8-3856f0794a64\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"fe0d3c0208e6\"><strong>Type</strong></p></th><th data-highlight-colour=\"#c2cace\" data-local-id=\"d430ffcd-5ad5-45a2-a29c-0615b5ceb507\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"0511452184ab\"><strong>Close/Pause</strong></p></th><th data-highlight-colour=\"#c2cace\" data-local-id=\"a61001c1-ff10-48f2-a24c-449d31968709\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"375f463ffaa3\"><strong>Pre-Open/Open</strong></p></th></tr><tr data-local-id=\"330ab75b-f810-4cc7-a9fc-b7c3751e7d12\"><td data-local-id=\"605f468e-557f-4345-8660-4f8e6986f84a\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"528604ecb2a3\">Saturday</p></td><td data-local-id=\"113d392e-1c6f-467b-8a37-11c4847c1831\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"cec3e1c0a284\">Extended Maintenance Window</p></td><td data-local-id=\"dbfbe74f-fa05-4250-92e4-e1df73d5053a\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"0c946aa4e0a5\">C<em>lose:</em> 2:00 a.m. to 3:45 a.m. CT</p></td><td data-local-id=\"67402b62-2718-407f-a907-c5c3f2b3ef49\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><ul local-id=\"b6e2671f-a24a-4946-b7bf-c3baa9f2093e\"><li local-id=\"8ef17f99-6305-47ea-b4d2-f4307f669090\"><p local-id=\"71d11aa12e22\"><em>Pre-open</em>: 3:45:00 a.m. to 4:00:00 a.m. CT</p></li><li local-id=\"c9fc2b43-f0e0-4317-b45d-9c1c97ce7172\"><p local-id=\"c10e912c8428\"><em>No cancel</em>: 3:59:30 a.m. to 4:00:00 a.m. CT</p></li><li local-id=\"106e3e2d-97a5-4c96-9086-2a7f1a077308\"><p local-id=\"339f8978e9f4\"><em>Open</em>: 4:00 a.m. CT</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-local-id=\"80746fda-69b6-49e6-b44c-8d595e813993\"><td data-local-id=\"3871fa8b-c2c4-4b03-b58b-67a2abf905ed\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"3c7580e38ffc\">Monday through Friday</p></td><td data-local-id=\"c4cbd346-566c-4122-878d-470e537964ef\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"5ea71a3d9695\">Daily Maintenance Window (with Trade Date roll)</p></td><td data-local-id=\"820a7b36-4605-4e5b-9fb2-88a0d6b0fb39\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"22f1095b534f\"><em>Close</em>: 3:00:00 p.m. to 4:01:00 p.m. CT</p></td><td data-local-id=\"493c692a-e6d6-4cd8-9d65-6040f5a76862\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><ul local-id=\"d0fcefeb-2bea-41b2-9a8f-d32c1cc324dc\"><li local-id=\"6fd3fb05-5c6c-4506-a43f-01104ef7f74b\"><p local-id=\"8f4fea9d1637\"><em>Pre-open: 4:01:00 p.m. to 4:01:30 p.m. CT</em></p></li><li local-id=\"37d5b4a9-d9d2-4695-adcc-21dc73dacc40\"><p local-id=\"9133c1619db1\"><em>No cancel: 4:01:30 p.m. to 4:02:00 p.m. CT</em></p></li><li local-id=\"a1c6f3e7-0267-4b57-8a10-f0459ae77fda\"><p local-id=\"4e263c5e4085\"><em>Open: 4:02:00 p.m. CT</em></p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 local-id=\"10be0d0f4bce\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-ProductScope\">Product Scope</h1><p local-id=\"9b16e9fb94a6\">With this launch, <em>only </em>the below <span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"713c3fd9-74e2-4c92-8c3b-b522f685450f\">event contracts on Bitcoin </span>on channel 329 will migrate to weekend trading.  <span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"76651b74-78bd-4e79-9805-b41718ae7ac1\">Other event contracts</span> will continue on the current schedule.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-table-width=\"1800\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-local-id=\"0451deb4-4880-4f02-8295-0ef2cccf541d\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><tbody><tr data-local-id=\"27b86f2775a0\"><th data-local-id=\"dae3a99a4129\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"be738b2946b1\"><strong>Product</strong></p></th><th data-local-id=\"a2a370dddad5\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"a42007ffd1f5\"><strong>MDP 3.0: Tag 6937-Asset</strong></p></th><th data-local-id=\"931dadd38c2e\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"0137140eed60\"><strong>iLink/MDP 3.0 Tag 1151-SecurityGroup</strong></p></th><th data-local-id=\"3d3e6a131b06\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"4aded989ee10\"><strong>Market Data Channel - MDP 3.0 Tag 1180-ApplID</strong></p></th><th data-local-id=\"2c16f241524c\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><p local-id=\"75f787e878dd\"><strong>Market Segment</strong></p></th></tr><tr data-local-id=\"174f2bd52d17\"><td data-local-id=\"567e99a12bbb\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"80fe30d23fc5\">Event contracts on Bitcoin Futures</p></td><td data-local-id=\"10e4c16d398e\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"84cb4bb7b5c7\">ECBTC</p></td><td data-local-id=\"77addbf802e5\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"cdff54adc382\">VB</p></td><td data-local-id=\"14a4c751d125\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"4d5c07b12552\">329</p></td><td data-local-id=\"072f67364973\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"9e9417edcb30\">74</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 local-id=\"18cffaaac42b\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-24/7Trading\">24/7 Trading</h1><p local-id=\"5cc3e6b5345a\">Trading impacts to 24/7 <span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"e0375165-3a06-4786-8845-053eaecf42a0\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/457323048/MDP+3.0+-+CME+Globex+Market+Data+Channel+Guide\" data-linked-resource-id=\"457323048\" data-linked-resource-version=\"21\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">trading</a> </span>for channel 329 align with the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/EPICSANDBOX/pages/1283194884/Cryptocurrency+Futures+and+Options+Migration+to+24-7+Trading\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1283194884\" data-linked-resource-version=\"46\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Cryptocurrency Futures and Options Migration to 24-7 Trading - <em>24/7 Trading</em></a>. Clients are encouraged to review the comprehensive technical information for the cryptocurrency migration to 24/7 trading.</p><h1 local-id=\"092b65efd046\" id=\"Event-BasedContractsExpansionto24-7Trading-24/7Clie